This weekend,
Marvel has revealed

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:09.660
some of the Marvel merch
available exclusively

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.490
at San Diego Comic Con.

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:15.390
Go head over there and watch
that video now on Marvel.com.

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:16.770
- I'm Langston.
- I'm Lorraine.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:17.580
 And this is Marvel.

